NOT COVERED BY THE ABOVE

The YOLO26x detector weights published alongside this repository at
https://huggingface.co/cpraschl/SeeingTheUnseen, under `yolo/`, are fine-tuned
from Ultralytics YOLO26x and are therefore licensed under **AGPL-3.0**, not MIT.
See https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html.

Everything in this repository, and every other artefact in that model
repository -- the detection heads under `heads/`, the PCA bases under `pca/`,
and the INSID3 positional bases under `bases/` -- is MIT as above.

Imagery derives from the public BAMBI dataset and keeps its own terms. The
DINOv3 and V-JEPA 2.1 backbones are used frozen and unmodified and are not
redistributed here; obtain them from their original sources under their own
licences.
